Package: shaderange
Title: Explore Foundation Shade Supply Across the Lightness Range
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Miriam", "Wu", , "mwuu0085@student.monash.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: 
    Provides foundation shade data from Sephora and Ulta, with
    each shade's colour summarised by its lightness. Includes a function
    for summarising shade supply by lightness band, and a Shiny app that
    helps beauty product strategists see where shade options are thin.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends: 
    R (>= 3.5)
LazyData: true
Imports: 
    bslib,
    dplyr,
    ggplot2,
    shiny
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
